FFF]gtd_checklist_glyphs_and_recurrence_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202610/gtd_checklist_glyphs_and_recurrence_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ak[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ak/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]PRE/POST checklist identity glyphs[/bold #D7AFFF]                            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]checklist-glyphs[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]checklist-glyphs: render a canonical, conflict-free `#task #gtd [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]#pre|#post` run as one teal sunrise or flag in the task identity slot. [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Covers Live Preview, rendered views, CSS-only Tasks rows, and the Today [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]🍅 reading-view anchor. Also adds the shared checklist-membership helper[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the recurrence guard reuses, and the task-tag-marks / today-marks [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract sections.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recurrence marks in Live Preview and rendered views[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]recurrence-marks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after checklist-glyphs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]recurrence-marks: render each canonical, Tasks-readable `\\[repeat:: …]` [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]as a quiet date-family mark (loop glyph plus spoken cadence label, exact[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rule in the tooltip). Adds the checklist `when done` guard, the repeat [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]repair flag, the \"Recurrence (not a date)\" date-marks contract section, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and the vault-format `repeat` row.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Recurrence marks in Tasks query results[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]recurrence-tasks[dim] · [dim][/dim]after recurrence-marks[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]recurrence-tasks: extend the full-mode Tasks frame pass to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`span.task-recurring`, draw the loop glyph in short mode with CSS, add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`hide recurrence rule` to the vault's blocked.md RECURRING query, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the RT conformance vectors.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ak","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ak.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","role_suffix":"plan","vcs_provider":"GitHub","workflow_name":"bob-cli-ak.1"},"source_run_id":"run-d85869b1b6726cbd5ba9692231c6823a","started_at":"2026-10-21T12:51:14.254396+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1792588829,"sha":"8a4936f4879a326034aae934c392c6e332d3c067","subject":"docs(task-tag-marks): specify PRE and POST glyph behavior"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"f07927c01468c88789fd81a37179c427b9c885c730f3a57699777afccc762ff5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ak.1--1/chat.md","size_bytes":10545},"commits":{"digest":"dd072103671c06e3927a4408936ebde0348605cd55ee6f03878c37001b59035a","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ak.1--1/commits.json","size_bytes":235},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"f46126fb9cd7c71b37ac213fa44ccd3ee5860f553f0d5f347f6c62b9f1275e73","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ak.1--1/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":67},"meta":{"digest":"778503c9a4df1daa5d322ffe220f529437ff37fbaa952d514fc2d6ba89adf000","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ak.1--1/meta.json","size_bytes":661},"prompt":{"digest":"62375bc2f8d29afbf400b65a90d2141a68e907235b8ee11aab35af92ed65fd62","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ak.1--1/prom